{"title":"Korean banana markets in everything","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/955369394/0/marginalrevolution~Korean-banana-markets-in-everything.html","date":1778050582000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Did you know Korea sells “one-a-day” banana packs?</p>\r\n<p>Instead of every banana ripening at once, each one is at a different stage.</p>\r\n<p>One is ready today.</p>\r\n<p>The next one is ready tomorrow.</p>\r\n<p>The last one is still spiritually in college, “experimenting.”</p>\r\n<p>Simple. Genius. Solves the entire banana problem.</p>\r\n<p>What do you think? Would you prefer your bananas this way?</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/soveyx/status/2051300109669814620?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">the tweet from Sovey</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/korean-banana-markets-in-everything.html\">Korean banana markets in everything</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/955369394/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/955369394/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/955369394/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/955369394/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/955369394/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/955369394/marginalrevolut